      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "栈溢出与 ret2libc / ROP",
      "section": [
        "栈溢出与 ret2libc / ROP",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. checksec：确认 canary/NX/PIE/RELRO；用 cyclic 找返回地址偏移。\n2. 有 puts/read 等泄漏函数时先泄 libc 地址，算 libc base。\n3. 用 ROP 调 system('/bin/sh')；注意 64 位栈对齐（ret gadget）。\n4. 无 libc 时考虑 ret2dlresolve 或 syscall ROP。",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 20,
      "truncated": false
    },
